n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">A couple of Ethels.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/4/4c/A_couple_of_Ethels..png/revision/latest?cb=20211111232128\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"A couple of Ethels.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/4/4c/A_couple_of_Ethels..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20211111232128\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/4/4c/A_couple_of_Ethels..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20211111232128 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/4/4c/A_couple_of_Ethels..png/revision/latest?cb=20211111232128 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"A couple of Ethels.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"A_couple_of_Ethels..png\" data-image-name=\"A couple of Ethels..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_12\" title=\"Series 12\">12</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alan_Davies\" title=\"Alan Davies\">Alan Davies</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_integrity_of_the_product.\" title=\"The integrity of the product.\">The integrity of the product.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nothing_matters.\" title=\"Nothing matters.\">Nothing matters.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>A couple of Ethels.</b></i> was the eighth episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_12\" title=\"Series 12\">Series 12</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a> on 11 November 2021. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Alan_Davies\" title=\"Alan Davies\">Alan Davies</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/A_couple_of_Ethels.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"A couple of Ethels\" were who <a href=\"/wiki/Guz_Khan\" title=\"Guz Khan\">Guz Khan</a> thought might be haunting the church in the <a href=\"/wiki/Make_and_wear_a_popcorn_necklace\" title=\"Make and wear a popcorn necklace\">Make and wear a popcorn necklace</a> task. The title card is of the bell used in the <a href=\"/wiki/Make_and_wear_a_popcorn_necklace\" title=\"Make and wear a popcorn necklace\">Make and wear a popcorn necklace</a> task.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/A_couple_of_Ethels.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Et par Edeler', which translates as 'A couple of Edels'.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Pari Etheliä', which translates as 'A couple of Ethels'.</li>\n<li>On Sweden's SVT Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Du får inte undvika att inte missa det här', which translates as 'You must not avoid to not miss this'. This title is simply referencing the confusing multiple negative clauses used in the task brief for the <a href=\"/wiki/Make_and_wear_a_popcorn_necklace\" title=\"Make and wear a popcorn necklace\">Make and wear a popcorn necklace</a> task.</li>\n<li>On Norway's Discovery+ Norge streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Et par Ethel', which translates as 'A couple of Ethels'. Note: this Norwegian translation of the title only appears in the subtitles for the episode, whereas the episode title listed on the platform is the original English title.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/A_couple_of_Ethels.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Alan_Davies\" title=\"Alan Davies\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Alan Davies</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Desiree_Burch\" title=\"Desiree Burch\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Desiree Burch</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Guz_Khan\" title=\"Guz Khan\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Guz Khan</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Morgana_Robinson\" title=\"Morgana Robinson\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Morgana Robinson</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Victoria_Coren_Mitchell\" title=\"Victoria Coren Mitchell\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Victoria Coren Mitchell</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Best_thing_you_use_for_something_other_than_its_actual_purpose\" title=\"Best thing you use for something other than its actual purpose\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Best thing you use for something other than its actual purpose.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Make_and_wear_a_popcorn_necklace\" title=\"Make and wear a popcorn necklace\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Make and wear a popcorn necklace with at least five pieces of popcorn and then do the opposite of the following: You must under no circumstances not avoid not making the bell not ring. The task is over when you have either rung the bell or not rung the bell and said \"I did the right thing\" three times. Fastest to not do the wrong thing wins. If you don't do the right thing, you lose five points.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>-5\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>-5\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Provide_the_most_iconic_and_memorable_commentary_for_this_brilliant_one_minute_of_socially_distanced_sport\" title=\"Provide the most iconic and memorable commentary for this brilliant one minute of socially distanced sport\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team:</b> Play the most brilliant minute of socially-distanced sport.\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><b>Team:</b> Provide the most iconic and memorable commentary for this brilliant one minute of socially-distanced sport. One of you must commentate on the action, another must provide analysis. Best commentary on the most brilliant socially-distanced sport wins.\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Make_your_face_look_like_another_face_when_your_face_is_turned_upside-down\" title=\"Make your face look like another face when your face is turned upside-down\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Make your face look like another face when your face is turned upside-down. Most expressive and radically different upside-down face wins.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Pop_up_before_the_object,_but_only_just\" title=\"Pop up before the object, but only just\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Pop up before the object, but only just. You are only allowed to pop up once. Closest to the pop before the pop wins the round. If you pop up after the object, you get no points that round.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Blow_a_feather_across_the_table_as_fast_as_possible\" title=\"Blow a feather across the table as fast as possible\">T</a>\n</td>\n<td>Blow the feather across the table using only your nose.\n</td>\n<td><b>✔</b>\n</td>\n<td>–\n</td>\n<td>✘\n</td>\n<td>–\n</td>\n<td>–\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\"><b>21</b>\n</td>\n<td>9\n</td>\n<td>21\n</td>\n<td>19\n</td>\n<td>9\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/A_couple_of_Ethels.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: External links\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://taskmaster.tv/shows/couple-ethels\"><i>A couple of Ethels.</i> on Taskmaster website</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.channel4.com/programmes/taskmaster/on-demand/70913-008\"><i>A couple of Ethels.</i> on All 4</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260920141512\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.071 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.135 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 672/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 26087/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 192/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 8/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.014/7.000 secon